{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>So shall it be done to the man who does not build his brother's house.</b> He deserves this disgrace, since he was unwilling to complete the building of the house that his brother began to build through his betrothal to her, as they said of blessed memory (Shabbat 118a): ״לֹא קָרָאתִי לְאִשְׁתִּי אֶלָּא בֵּיתִי״ — \"I did not call my wife anything but 'my house.'\""], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:09.882017806Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}